'''Splitnir the Storming''' is the upgraded form of [[Splitnir]] using [[Iolite]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use [[Iolite]], it has 10 additional [[Lightning|lightning damage]] and a 25% chance to apply [[Chain Lightning]].

* Its primary attack is a thrust. 
* The secondary attack throws the spear for 1.5x damage.

An upgraded Splitnir will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is made into Splitnir the Storming.

